  "schema_version": 2,
  "note": "Benchmark manifest for `python -m nctool compare`: the fixed set of scans and cases two builds are compared over (scripts/analysis/README.md, 'Compare two builds'). A case runs on a build only when it has a block for the output interface that build speaks -- `destination` (pipeline_version >= 8) or `preset` (the reference build, scripts/reference-snapshot/) -- each holding that interface's `args` and optional `recipe`; a case's top-level `args` go to every build it runs on. Every preset block that renders a display image states the reference config's `--preset sigmoid-knees`. Roll cases name frames; the asset inventory (paths + sha256) stays in <asset-root>/manifest.json. Records made before nf-verification/benchmark-set (2026-10-01) are superseded: the pre-migration pipeline is compared by re-running the reference build over this set, not by keeping its old cases.",
  "sets": {
